 "provenance": "Hierarchical clustering of CONTROL replicate x cell-type pseudobulk profiles. The linkage matrix itself was not archived, so the spine geometry was recovered verbatim from the shipped panel sc_endom_EDITABLE_SVG/fig3_remake/figures_svg/Fig3n_swarm_matrix_4stage.svg (15/15 polylines inverted to data coordinates; leaf order matches Fig3n_swarm_row_order.csv exactly). Recomputation from the staged pseudobulk (log1p CPM, top-2000 variable genes across CTRL_1/CTRL_2 columns, correlation distance, average linkage) reproduces 14 of the 15 merges; the one discordance is Macrophage+Macrophage/APC (shipped) vs Dendritic cell (cDC1)+Macrophage/APC (recomputed), i.e. a swap inside the myeloid clade that does not change the leaf order. The shipped geometry is therefore used as the definition layer.",
